  "body": "I have a problem with testing `device-info` sample in Mac\n\nI'm testing on macOs 10.12 Beta with Chrome Version 54.0.2800.0 canary (64-bit) \n\nWhen I try to get device info form own UUID(713d0100-503e-4c75-ba94-3148f18d941e) which is advertised from a watch(android), I can't find my watch in the pair popup.\n(I tested with predefined Bluetooth service and BLE Peripheral Simulator app and I get the device info in Mac)\n\nHowever when I test the same thing on chromebook, Google Chrome OS Version 52.0.2743.57 beta (64-bit), I get my watch on the popup list and the `device-info` sample works perfectly.\n\nIn both cases I already paired the watch with the OS.\n\nDo you have clue what is going wrong in Mac? I can provide more debugging info if it's needed.\n",
